 "_about": "Layer 2 (product line) and layer 3 (series) of Cisco wireless, 14 Sep 2026. Access points by Cisco family and model; controllers by platform; Meraki MR bare family rows in their own line. The series ROLE is the access-point deploy_role the cup engine reads (deployRole.ts, axis ap): every role here reproduces the III.0 SKU rules row for row (checked when written: 0 changes). The Aironet 1552 is split because its models carry two roles (E/I/C outdoor, H/SA/SD/WU hazardous-location industrial). SKU prefixes AIR-, PROMO-, PPN-, KAISER- and the glued AIRAP are matched explicitly (placePart strips only 2D-/C1-/EDU-/NAL-).",
